post-it: Visual artifacting
cause: Overheated GPU
symptoms:
	Garbled picture
	Colours look wrong
checks:
	yes: Windows starts
	yes: Memory test passes
	yes: Shows a picture at power-on
	yes: Windows stays up after the desktop appears
	no: Bluescreen after the desktop appears
	no: Freezes with a buzz after the desktop appears
	yes: CPU fan is clean and spins freely
	no: CPU fan is clogged or blocked
	yes: GPU heatsink is scorched
		shows: in the Workview
	yes: Coloured blocks and torn lines on screen
		shows: from power-on
	no: Picture is clean
	yes: Every part sits in its own place
	no: CPU socket is empty
	no: Fans run but no picture
	no: High contrast colour scheme
hardware steps:
	Open case
	Trash the GPU
	Fit a new GPU
	Close case
